    <string name="mochi_intro">Pull Mochi back, read the dotted arc, release.\nFlowers wilt under him: keep moving.</string>
    <string name="mochi_rules">Drag anywhere and release: Mochi flies the other way, along the dotted arc. A glowing flower means a catch, a red cross means a thorn or a bee.\n\nFlowers wilt while Mochi rests on them. Golden flowers never wilt and give a dew bubble.\n\nA dew bubble catches Mochi once, when he falls or gets stung. Six peaches ripen the next bubble; a star fruit gives one right away.\n\nLand on the heart of a new flower to grow a Perfect streak. Brambles bounce Mochi back and a ricochet landing pays extra.</string>
